OL,3,GNEWSATown trying to fill gap in NHS
OL,4,Adental care
OL,5,
OL,6,FA community is working together to
OL,7,Ftackle a lack of NHS dental services.
OL,9,FThe Goods Shed, a community space in
OL,10,FWadebridge, Cornwall, has been hosting
OL,11,Fvisits from a mobile dental treatment
OL,12,Fservice which runs emergency clinics on
OL,13,Fbehalf of the NHS.
OL,15,FBut the trustees of the community
OL,16,Finterest company which runs the centre
OL,17,Fare also lobbying for a permanent
OL,18,Fdentist's chair in the building, with
OL,19,Fdirector Stephen Knightly describing
OL,20,FNHS dental health services in Cornwall
OL,21,Fas among the "worst in the UK".
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
