OL,3,GNEWSATown trying to fill gap in NHS
OL,4,Adental care
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Department of Health spokesperson
OL,7,Fsaid it was taking action to fix NHS
OL,8,Fdentistry after "decades of decline"
OL,9,Fbut added there was "more to do".
